          ],
          "default": "sound",
          "effective": "sound",
          "help": {
            "en": "System notification when a card reaches In review: off / banner / banner + sound (default). Other notifications are unaffected.",
            "zh": "卡片进入「待验收」时的系统通知：关 / 横幅 / 横幅+声音（默认）。其余通知不受影响。"
          },
