          "placeholder": {
            "en": "",
            "zh": ""
          },
          "source": "default"
        }
      ],
      "help": {
        "en": "System notifications are posted by the board app (§28); no app running = no banners. Permission status: Permissions checkup.",
        "zh": "系统通知由看板 app（壳）投递（§28）；app 没开就没有系统通知。通知权限见「权限体检」。"
      },
      "id": "notifications",
      "title": {
        "en": "Notifications",
        "zh": "通知"
